  "body": {
    "type": "doc",
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "This serves 4 and takes about 35 minutes including cooking and assembling. The thing to get right is the eggs: you want the yolk just set with a slight softness in the centre, not hard boiled all the way through."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Do not dress the salad until the moment you serve it. The acid in the dressing wilts the leaves quickly and makes the beans look dull."
          }
        ]
      },
